{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The bend type is used in guitar notation and tablature. A single note with a bend and release will contain two"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bend elements: the first to represent the bend and the second to represent the release. The shape attribute"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"distinguishes between the angled bend symbols commonly used in standard notation and the curved bend symbols"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"commonly used in both tablature and standard notation."}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBend\/init(alter:content:withBar:shape:position:font:color:sound:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBend\/alter","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBend\/color","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBend\/content-swift.property","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBend\/font","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBend\/position","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBend\/shape-swift.property","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBend\/sound","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBend\/withBar"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBend\/Content-swift.enum","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBend\/Shape-swift.enum"],"anchor":"Enumerations","title":"Enumerations","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBend\/Equatable-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","generated":true}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorMX